WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,290
Wait, I have something to say

2
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:15,270
Boss, I was wrong. I was really wrong.

3
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:17,550
I kowtow to you and I will give you all the supplies.

4
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:21,230
A thousand warm water pinches, please let me live, it's too late

5
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,650
A secondary van was detected

6
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,170
Wear level 38%

7
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,330
The appraisal price is 199 survival coins

8
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:40,050
Please help me leave the hot water bottle in the car and sell it. I'll receive it.

9
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,100
This is the first one and the next two

10
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,380
Okay. It should be four.

11
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,460
You've all washed your necks and you're all fine.
